Windows.Storage in-memory streams for the private Wine 10.20 lab.

Backported from Wine 58ab210fd2646701ffcdb0751694dfc1cc7b5947
(dlls/windows.storage, including its tests). The boolean async wrapper
comes from Wine 10.20 dlls/windows.gaming.input/async.c.

Local additions: real FlushAsync; serialized stream state; lifetime,
error-propagation, EOF, allocation-overflow and shrink/regrow fixes;
stream metadata and agile identity; flush/bounds/concurrent-write regression tests.
Upstream CloneStream and positioned substream stubs remain explicit.

